founders & operators</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400\"></i>\n                        <span>Adapts to any business model</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400\"></i>\n                        <span>Real-time cross-functional insights</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"selector-section\" class=\"py-12 px-4 bg-[#0d0d0d] sticky top-24 z-40\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center lg:text-left\">\n                        <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 mb-2\">I am a...</div>\n                        <div class=\"pill-selector\">\n                            <div class=\"pill-option active\" data-role=\"founder\">Founder</div>\n                            <div class=\"pill-option\" data-role=\"ceo\">CEO</div>\n                            <div class=\"pill-option\" data-role=\"coo\">COO</div>\n                            <div class=\"pill-option\" data-role=\"finance\">Finance Leader</div>\n                            <div class=\"pill-option\" data-role=\"cio\">CIO/CTO</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-center lg:text-left\">\n                        <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 mb-2\">Running a...</div>\n                        <div class=\"pill-selector overflow-x-auto\">\n                            <div class=\"pill-option active\" data-business=\"saas\">SaaS</div>\n                            <div class=\"pill-option\" data-business=\"retail\">Retail</div>\n                            <div class=\"pill-option\" data-business=\"agency\">Agency</div>\n                            <div class=\"pill-option\" data-business=\"manufacturing\">Manufacturing</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"pain-section\" class=\"py-20 px-4\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6\">\n                        <span class=\"text-white\">The 12-Tab</span><br>\n                        <span class=\"text-gradient\">Morning Routine</span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n                        Without a unified memory system, you're forced to act as the manual bridge between your apps\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-red-500/50\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-red-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-window-maximize text-red-400 text-xl\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-white\">Manual Data Compilation</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">Checking Stripe for revenue, HubSpot for pipeline, Jira for engineering health, Slack for team updates—every single morning</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-orange-500/50\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-orange-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-eye-slash text-orange-400 text-xl\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-white\">Cross-Functional Blind Spots</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">Support ticket spike + hiring freeze might not connect until something breaks. Data silos hide critical patterns</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-yellow-500/50\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-yellow-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-clock text-yellow-400 text-xl\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-white\">Always Reacting</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">By the time you manually compile metrics, you're reacting rather than acting. No proactive intelligence</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"solution-section\" class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-[#0d0d0d]\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6\">\n                        <span class=\"text-gradient\">One Command Center.</span><br>\n                        <span class=\"text-white\">Cross-Functional Intelligence.</span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n                        Turn operational chaos into governed, AI-powered visibility\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-8\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 mb-6\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFE1CC] to-[#FFFFFF] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\">\n                                <i class=\"fas fa-database text-[#111111] text-xl\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Unified Digital Memory</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-gray-400\">Connects revenue, pipeline, operations, and team capacity apps into one governed data layer—automatically cleaned and unified</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10\">Stripe</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10\">HubSpot</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10\">Jira</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10\">Slack</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10\">QuickBooks</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10\">Google Analytics</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10\">Zendesk</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10\">+15 more</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-8\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 mb-6\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFE1CC] to-[#FFFFFF] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\">\n                                <i class=\"fas fa-brain text-[#111111] text-xl\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">AI Twin Morning Briefing</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-gray-400\">Daily intelligence that connects the dots across departments with evidence-backed operational insights</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#111111] rounded-xl p-3 border border-red-500/30\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\">\n                                    <i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-circle text-red-400 text-sm mt-0.5\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                                        <div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-red-300\">Critical Alert</div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">Support load increased 40% while hiring pipeline is empty—this will break in 3 weeks</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#111111] rounded-xl p-3 border border-yellow-500/30\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\">\n                                    <i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-yellow-400 text-sm mt-0.5\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                                        <div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-yellow-300\">Operational Risk</div>\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">Burn rate up 15%, pipeline velocity down 22%—forecast miss likely</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n      