        <button class=\"text-xs text-[#ffb22c] font-semibold\">Review</button>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                    <span>Escalate support bottleneck</span>\n                                    <button class=\"text-xs text-[#ffb22c] font-semibold\">Review</button>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                    <span>Pause hiring in dept X</span>\n                                    <button class=\"text-xs text-[#ffb22c] font-semibold\">Review</button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-8\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 mb-6\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFE1CC] to-[#FFFFFF] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\">\n                                <i class=\"fas fa-history text-[#111111] text-xl\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Decision Memory</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-gray-400\">Every approved action flows back into your Digital Memory—your business gets smarter every day</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#111111] rounded-xl p-4 border border-white/5\">\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-gray-500\">Decisions Made</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-lg font-bold\">1,247</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-gray-500\">Patterns Learned</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-lg font-bold\">89</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-gray-500\">Time Saved</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-green-400\">142hrs</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-gray-500\">Accuracy</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-green-400\">94%</div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFE1CC] to-[#FFFFFF] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-chart-line text-[#111111] text-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Real-Time KPI Tracking</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">Monitor MRR, burn rate, pipeline velocity, engineering health—all updated live and business-adapted</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFE1CC] to-[#FFFFFF] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-sitemap text-[#111111] text-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Cross-Functional Pattern Detection</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">See how sales, support, product, finance, and operations connect to predict outcomes before they happen</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFE1CC] to-[#FFFFFF] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-bell text-[#111111] text-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2\">FinPulse Anomaly Detection</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">AI flags financial leaks, unusual spending patterns, and revenue anomalies automatically</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFE1CC] to-[#FFFFFF] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-tasks text-[#111111] text-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Approval Workflows</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">Structured governance for AI-proposed actions—you stay in control of every operational decision</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"bg-card rounded-2xl p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFE1CC] to-[#FFFFFF] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-tachometer-alt text-[#111111] text-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Ops Dashboard</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">Single unified view of your entire business—revenue, pipeline, operations, team capacity</p>\n                    </div>\n\n           