gray-400 mb-4\">Track Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR), burn rate, active deals, engineering pipeline, and team health</p>\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-3 text-sm\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-[#111111] rounded-lg p-3\">\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">MRR</div>\n                                        <div class=\"font-bold text-green-400\">$284K</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-[#111111] rounded-lg p-3\">\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Burn Rate</div>\n                                        <div class=\"font-bold\">$142K/mo</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-[#111111] rounded-lg p-3\">\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Active Deals</div>\n                                        <div class=\"font-bold\">24</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-[#111111] rounded-lg p-3\">\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Eng Pipeline</div>\n                                        <div class=\"font-bold text-green-400\">Healthy</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-[#111111] rounded-lg p-3\">\n                                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Team Health</div>\n                                        <div class=\"font-bold text-yellow-400\">82/100</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"content-section\" data-business-content=\"retail\">\n  